    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Honor. Vengeance. Precision.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>The Legend of Kuro</i>, you take on the role of Kuro, a samurai frog determined to avenge the destruction of his village by the demons who took everything he once loved. On his journey through cursed lands, Kuro will face escalating dangers, relentless enemies, and hidden truths about his own destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This challenging 2D platformer demands quick reflexes and pinpoint precision, with unique mechanics like dashing between orbs and striking down enemies with lightning-fast attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each step forward, Kuro grows stronger, unlocking new abilities. But one question remains: how much of himself will he lose in the pursuit of vengeance?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the battlefield with swift dashes and precise strikes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395470/extras/470855d357d61dbb466792848eed4210.poster.avif?t=1754750662\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395470/extras/470855d357d61dbb466792848eed4210.webm?t=1754750662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395470/extras/470855d357d61dbb466792848eed4210.mp4?t=1754750662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Between battles, find refuge and wisdom in the Village of the Rising Sun.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395470/extras/b974ee75fbed4736060ae2f32445542c.poster.avif?t=1754750662\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395470/extras/b974ee75fbed4736060ae2f32445542c.webm?t=1754750662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395470/extras/b974ee75fbed4736060ae2f32445542c.mp4?t=1754750662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face colossal bosses with unique patterns and striking visuals.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395470/extras/884a6587270905eabc49880dc2b24f80.poster.avif?t=1754750662\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395470/extras/884a6587270905eabc49880dc2b24f80.webm?t=1754750662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395470/extras/884a6587270905eabc49880dc2b24f80.mp4?t=1754750662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Honor. Vengeance. Precision.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>The Legend of Kuro</i>, you take on the role of Kuro, a samurai frog determined to avenge the destruction of his village by the demons who took everything he once loved. On his journey through cursed lands, Kuro will face escalating dangers, relentless enemies, and hidden truths about his own destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This challenging 2D platformer demands quick reflexes and pinpoint precision, with unique mechanics like dashing between orbs and striking down enemies with lightning-fast attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each step forward, Kuro grows stronger, unlocking new abilities. But one question remains: how much of himself will he lose in the pursuit of vengeance?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the battlefield with swift dashes and precise strikes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395470/extras/470855d357d61dbb466792848eed4210.poster.avif?t=1754750662\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395470/extras/470855d357d61dbb466792848eed4210.webm?t=1754750662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395470/extras/470855d357d61dbb466792848eed4210.mp4?t=1754750662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Between battles, find refuge and wisdom in the Village of the Rising Sun.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395470/extras/b974ee75fbed4736060a